{"boundary":"This is static tracked source text. Use it for source grounding only; do not infer private runtime state from it.","chunkCount":6,"chunkHash":"77160cf61d41d1bf9b1f53ab8896879745394d74a22a588a7eb30312d7cf562f","chunkIndex":5,"chunkText":"                            .foregroundStyle(.red)
